ted in the wings. In 1942, the first Jagdbombers were operating over Britain and they reached the Eastern Front in time to bomb Soviet positions in Stalingrad and later they were used successfully in the Battle of Kursk.","LocalizedString":"The Fw 190 A Jagdbomber, aka Jabo, was a German fighter-bomber variant of the Fw 190 Würger fighter. The Fw 190 A series included many variants, but the first Jagdbomber was the Fw 190 A-3/U3 which could carry up to 500 kg of bombs or a standard Luftwaffe drop tank. The Jagdbombers were also heavily armed, with a 7.92 mm MG 17 in the fuselage and two 20 mm MG 151 cannons mounted in the wings. In 1942, the first Jagdbombers were operating over Britain and they reached the Eastern Front in time to bomb Soviet positions in Stalingrad and later they were used successfully in the Battle of Kursk."},"operationCost":2,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Unique","selectTargetOnPlayedFromHand":true,"cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Breakthrough","isInPermanentPool":true,"extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Deployment"],"hasDeployment":true,"soundBlowUp":{"ObjectName":"SoundCue'AU_Exp_Aircraft_Medium_Cue'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Card_Blowups/AU_Exp_Aircraft_Medium_Cue.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Germany/t_fw_190_a.t_fw_190_a","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Jarosław Wróbel","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/FW_190_A_JAGDBOMBER.FW_190_A_JAGDBOMBER","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":353.0},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_germany","Key":"card_unit_fw_190_f_photo","SourceString":"FW 190 Jagdbomber in flight, ca 1942-45.","LocalizedString":"FW 190 Jagdbomber in flight, ca 1942-45."},"blowUpExplosion":{"ObjectName":"ParticleSystem'P_ExplosionAircraftL'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Effects/Explosions/Large/Aircraft/P_ExplosionAircraftL.201"},"blowUpCameraShake":{"ObjectName":"BlueprintGeneratedClass'CameraShakeHeavy_C'","ObjectPath":"kards/Co